# Every file keeps its bytes as written, on every platform. The harness checks sha256 hashes of its vouched files
# (ouroboros/stageb.py), and the pre-registration hashes more. Several were written with CRLF endings, and their
# declared hashes cover those exact bytes, so git converts nothing.
* -text
*.safetensors binary
*.npy binary
*.npz binary
*.parquet binary
*.png binary
